      "raw_text": "Ring Referral: Efficient Publicly Verifiable Ad hoc Credential Scheme with Issuer and Strong User Anonymity for Decentralized Identity and More"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "tei:year",
      "source": "grobid_tei",
